ess school well  but this is a job that people find  essential this is something that helped  keep people's sanity throughout all of  2020 especially when folks were like  living alone for months and months they  turning to Art turning to different kind  of story based mediums is something that  makes you feel a connection to humanity  as a whole so I would say it's not  necessarily our job it's our opportunity  you don't have to do it I love vanity  content as much as the next guy  sometimes I want to sit down and be like  that was fun and I it was Mindless and I  had a great time but for me I feel that  I have the opportunity  to be able to change people's minds with  the stories that I make and tell and so  for me that feels like a responsibility

